           1997 IEEE Workshop on Nonlinear Signal and Image Processing, London,
           UK.
           https://www.iwaenc.org/proceedings/1997/nsip97/pdf/scan/ns970226.pdf
    .. [2] https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rhombicuboctahedron
    """
